{"id":915,"date":"2025-05-21T15:55:09","date_gmt":"2025-05-21T10:25:09","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/kaveriuniversity.edu.in\/?page_id=915"},"modified":"2026-04-08T11:58:14","modified_gmt":"2026-04-08T06:28:14","slug":"admission-procedure","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/kaveriuniversity.edu.in\/admission-procedure\/","title":{"rendered":"Admission procedure"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"915\" class=\"elementor elementor-915\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-82e9a6c elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"82e9a6c\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-8d8ce04\" data-id=\"8d8ce04\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4d4ce32 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4d4ce32\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Introduction<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4a9c443 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4a9c443\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Kaveri University, a multidisciplinary education and research institution, offers undergraduate and postgraduate programs aligned with ICAR, NEP 2020, UGC norms, and industry needs. Admissions to the flagship B.Sc. (Hons.) Agriculture, B.Tech. and M.Sc. (Ag) programs are conducted through a merit-based, transparent, and student-centric process designed to attract capable, motivated, and diverse learners.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-e9a6de7 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"e9a6de7\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-32279d5\" data-id=\"32279d5\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6a5d9f6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6a5d9f6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Admission Procedure<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f82d074 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f82d074\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Step 1: Online Application<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Candidates must apply through the official Kaveri University admission portal<\/li><li>Upload academic records, ID proof, passport-size photo, and entrance test scores (if applicable)<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-460afc7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"460afc7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Step 2: Entrance Test \/ Merit Evaluation<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>For B.Tech.: Based on EAMCET rank \/ JEE Main rank \/ Merit<\/li><li>For B.Sc. (Hons.) Agriculture: Based on merit in 10+2 (Bi.P.C\/M.P.C stream); university may conduct Agriculture Aptitude Test if required<\/li><\/ul><p>Scholarships as per university guidelines<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-62d5e9d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"62d5e9d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Step 3: Counselling and Document Verification<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Shortlisted candidates will be invited for online\/offline counselling<\/li><li>Original documents will be verified for eligibility confirmation<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a5ceb10 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a5ceb10\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Step 4: Provisional Admission Offer<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Issued based on merit, entrance test score, availability of seats, and document verification<\/li><li>Candidates must confirm admission by paying the admissionfee within the stipulated time<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-662936e elementor-hidden-desktop elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-mobile elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"662936e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol start=\"5\"><li><strong> Key Dates<\/strong><\/li><\/ol><table><tbody><tr><td width=\"226\"><p><strong>Event <\/strong><\/p><\/td><td width=\"375\"><p>Date<\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"226\"><p><strong>Application Start Date<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td width=\"375\"><p>1<sup>st<\/sup>May, 2025<\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"226\"><p><strong>Last Date for Application<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td width=\"375\"><ul><li>B.Sc. (Hons.) Ag \u2013 10<sup>th<\/sup> July, 2025<\/li><li>B.Tech.(CSE\/AI &amp; ML) \u2013 10<sup>th<\/sup> July, 2025<\/li><li>M.Sc. (Ag) \u2013 30<sup>th<\/sup> July, 2025<\/li><\/ul><\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"226\"><p><strong>Merit List \/ Counselling<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td width=\"375\"><ul><li>B.Sc. (Hons.) Ag \u2013 20<sup>th<\/sup> July, 2025<\/li><li>B.Tech. (CSE\/AI &amp; ML) \u2013 20<sup>th<\/sup> July, 2025<\/li><li>M.Sc (Ag) \u2013 20<sup>th<\/sup> August, 2025<\/li><\/ul><\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"226\"><p><strong>Orientation and Classes Begin<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td width=\"375\"><ul><li>B.Sc. (Hons.) Ag \u2013 1<sup>st<\/sup> August, 2025<\/li><li>B.Tech. (CSE\/AI &amp; ML) \u2013 4<sup>th<\/sup> August, 2025<\/li><li>M.Sc. (Ag) \u2013 1<sup>st<\/sup> September, 2025<\/li><\/ul><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-68838f8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"68838f8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol start=\"5\">\n<li><strong> Key Dates<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>Admissions for the academic year 2026-27 are now open. We look forward to welcoming you to our university .<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-1c6a952 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"1c6a952\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-4a55557\" data-id=\"4a55557\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4836405 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4836405\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Scholarships and Financial Aid<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a31fbb8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a31fbb8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Merit Scholarships \u2013 Recognising Excellence, Supporting the Future<br \/><\/strong>Kaveri University offers scholarships to meritorious students who<br \/>demonstrate exceptional academic performance, leadership qualities, or<br \/>outstanding talent in specific fields. Students from economically weaker<br \/>backgrounds are also considered for support. These scholarships are<br \/>designed to reward potential, foster academic excellence, and provide<br \/>financial assistance so that students can focus on their studies and achieve<br \/>their highest aspirations.<br \/><br \/><strong>Special Scholarships for Girls from Rural Areas<\/strong><br \/>In addition to merit-based awards, the university has introduced dedicated<br \/>scholarships for girls from rural backgrounds. This initiative aims to<br \/>promote gender equality and create opportunities for those who may face<br \/>additional challenges in accessing higher education. By enabling rural girls<br \/>to pursue university studies, we seek to empower them to excel<br \/>academically, become change-makers in their communities, and realise their<br \/>ambitions.<br \/><br \/><strong>Building a Diverse and Inclusive Academic Community<\/strong><br \/>Through these scholarship programmes, the university nurtures a culture of<br \/>diversity, inclusivity, and excellence. By supporting talented students from<br \/>varied social, economic, and geographic backgrounds, we ensure that higher<br \/>education remains accessible to all who have the talent and determination<br \/>to succeed \u2014 enabling them to contribute meaningfully to their fields and to<br \/>society.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-a6c93a7 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"a6c93a7\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-830c249\" data-id=\"830c249\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0f69a05 elementor-widget elementor-widg